er/Ice, Electric, Plant, Evil Wind, Fire, Earth).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193670/extras/8443cf570371b6ee06652f21be4275aa.poster.avif?t=1711420583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193670/extras/8443cf570371b6ee06652f21be4275aa.webm?t=1711420583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193670/extras/8443cf570371b6ee06652f21be4275aa.mp4?t=1711420583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>2 player mode</u></h2>Play with a friend on the same computer in 2 player mode.<br>Player 1 requires a keyboard and mouse, player 2 requires a joystick (Gamepad).<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193670/extras/ad94aee55e0c2487b56e775e1ed434bf.poster.avif?t=1711420583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193670/extras/ad94aee55e0c2487b56e775e1ed434bf.webm?t=1711420583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193670/extras/ad94aee55e0c2487b56e775e1ed434bf.mp4?t=1711420583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u>Help Dr. Albert</u></h2>The main objective of the game is to deliver the 6 Boomags to Dr. Albert because only he can save us from this uncontrolled mutation of Cymuts and Mutrobos.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193670/extras/6980543dc94b047961a5b89d8bdf9c63.poster.avif?t=1711420583\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2193670/extras/6980543dc94b047